WEBVTT

00:17.400 --> 00:18.000
Report!

00:18.160 --> 00:20.500
The Wunu are driving the refugees to assault the city!

00:20.700 --> 00:21.800
What did you say?!

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
They're forcing the refugees to assault the walls!

00:40.080 --> 00:41.500
Hurry, come with me!

00:42.080 --> 00:43.000
Faster!

00:43.520 --> 00:44.100
I beg you...

00:44.160 --> 00:47.000
I don't want to die! Let me go back!

00:51.280 --> 00:52.500
Move forward!

00:53.640 --> 00:56.500
Set the ladders against the walls to survive!

01:02.600 --> 01:04.500
Archers, take position!

01:20.120 --> 01:20.800
This...

01:21.000 --> 01:22.500
Please don't mind.

01:23.240 --> 01:25.500
I am Prince of Jin Sikong Yao of Great Xuan.

01:25.560 --> 01:27.000
I promise you all:

01:27.640 --> 01:29.800
The royal army will surely recover our homeland,

01:30.080 --> 01:31.400
and restore for everyone

01:31.560 --> 01:33.200
a peaceful world!

01:41.600 --> 01:42.500
Your Highness!

01:43.560 --> 01:45.500
The enemy has entered firing range!
